Hotel Bill - Menu Billing Script

Overview

This is a simple command-line hotel menu and billing script (`Hotel Bill.py`). It displays a menu, accepts item numbers and quantities, and prints a bill including SGST and CGST (9% each).

Usage

Run the script and follow the prompts:

python "c:\\College things\\Python\\Hotel Bill.py"

Enter item numbers and quantities; enter 0 to finish ordering.

Notes

- To edit the menu, update the `self.menu` dictionary in `Hotel Bill.py`.
- File saved as `REAHMEHM` per request.